---
description: >-
  From v12's ganttDb.spec.ts (issue 4121): the milestone M1 has its id "m1" in the duration
  field, so it has no id and "after m1" names no task. The unknown-id warning says what
  "after" does and adds the milestone hint, though the task that wrote the "after" is no
  milestone.
---
gantt
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  M1 :milestone, 2023-01-01, m1
  task :t1, after m1, 1d
